* ============================================================
* LIST_ORDERED_STUDENTS_CNX_BASELINE_X32_V2.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Baseline regression for LIST behavior under active ordered
*   traversal on X32 STUDENTS / STUDENTS_X32_IDXTEST.
*
* Scope:
*   - CNX ordered traversal where available
*   - SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
*   - SET ORDER TO TAG FNAME
*   - ASCEND / DESCEND
*   - TOP / BOTTOM / SKIP / GO
*   - SEEK anchoring
*   - duplicate-key zones
*   - LIST / LIST TOP / LIST BOTTOM / LIST ALL
*   - ordered + FOR
*   - ordered + SET FILTER TO
*   - return to physical order
*
* Notes:
*   - Uses SELECT by table name, not stale area numbers.
*   - If STUDENTS does not own LNAME/FNAME CNX tags in this build,
*     this script will expose that immediately and should be run
*     against STUDENTS_X32_IDXTEST instead.
*   - LIST is still treated as a developer/report command.
*   - Use AREA and STATUS after each important movement.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO OFF

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO LIST ORDERED STUDENTS CNX BASELINE X32 V2 START
ECHO ============================================================

COLOR DEFAULT
VERSION

DO X32
WORKSPACE OPEN DBF
WSREPORT ALL

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 0: SELECT ORDER TEST TABLE
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 0: SELECT ORDER TEST TABLE
ECHO ============================================================

SELECT STUDENTS
AREA
FIELDS
COUNT
STATUS

ECHO --- TRY LNAME ORDER ON STUDENTS ---
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
AREA
STATUS

* If the above fails in this build, manually switch this script to:
*   SELECT STUDENTS_X32_IDXTEST
* before accepting the ordered baseline.

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 1: LNAME ASCENDING ORDER
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 1: LNAME ASCENDING ORDER
ECHO ============================================================

ASCEND
TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- REPEAT LIST 5 WITHOUT MOVING ---
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SKIP 5 THEN LIST 5 ---
TOP
SKIP 5
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- GO TOP / GO BOTTOM ---
GO TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

GO BOTTOM
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- LIST TOP ---
LIST TOP
AREA

ECHO --- LIST BOTTOM ---
LIST BOTTOM
AREA

ECHO --- LIST ALL ---
GO TOP
LIST ALL
AREA
STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 2: ORDERED SEEK ANCHORING / LNAME
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 2: ORDERED SEEK ANCHORING / LNAME
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
ASCEND
TOP
AREA

ECHO --- SEEK ANDERSON ---
SEEK ANDERSON
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SKIP 1 AFTER SEEK ---
SKIP 1
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SEEK BROWN ---
SEEK BROWN
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SEEK CLARK ---
SEEK CLARK
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SEEK DAVIS ---
SEEK DAVIS
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 3: DUPLICATE KEY ZONE / LNAME
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 3: DUPLICATE KEY ZONE / LNAME
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
ASCEND
SEEK ANDERSON
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

SKIP 1
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

SKIP 1
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

SKIP 1
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

SKIP 1
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

SKIP 1
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA
STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 4: ORDERED + FOR / LNAME
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 4: ORDERED + FOR / LNAME
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
ASCEND
TOP
AREA

ECHO --- LIST FOR LNAME = "ANDERSON" ---
LIST FOR LNAME = "ANDERSON"
AREA

ECHO --- LIST 10 FOR MAJOR = "CSCI" ---
TOP
LIST 10 FOR MAJOR = "CSCI"
AREA

ECHO --- LIST ALL FOR GENDER = "F" ---
TOP
LIST ALL FOR GENDER = "F"
AREA

ECHO --- SEEK CLARK THEN LIST FOR LNAME = "CLARK" ---
SEEK CLARK
AREA
LIST FOR LNAME = "CLARK"
AREA
STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 5: ORDERED + SET FILTER TO / LNAME
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 5: ORDERED + SET FILTER TO / LNAME
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
ASCEND
SET FILTER TO LNAME = "CLARK"
TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- REPEAT LIST 5 UNDER FILTER ---
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SKIP 2 UNDER FILTER ---
SKIP 2
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

COUNT

ECHO --- CLEAR FILTER ---
SET FILTER TO
TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA
STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 6: FNAME ASCENDING ORDER
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 6: FNAME ASCENDING ORDER
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO TAG FNAME
ASCEND
TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SEEK ADRIEN ---
SEEK ADRIEN
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- SKIP 5 AFTER FNAME SEEK/TOP ---
SKIP 5
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

ECHO --- BOTTOM / LIST ---
BOTTOM
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 7: LNAME DESCENDING ORDER
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 7: LNAME DESCENDING ORDER
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
DESCEND
AREA
STATUS

TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

SKIP 5
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

BOTTOM
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

LIST TOP
AREA

LIST BOTTOM
AREA

ASCEND
SET ORDER TO TAG LNAME
TOP
AREA
LIST
AREA
STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 8: ORDER RESET / PHYSICAL RETURN
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 8: ORDER RESET / PHYSICAL RETURN
ECHO ============================================================

SET ORDER TO 0
TOP
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

SKIP 5
AREA
LIST 5
AREA

STATUS

* ------------------------------------------------------------
* SECTION 9: FINAL RESTORATION
* ------------------------------------------------------------
ECHO ============================================================
ECHO SECTION 9: FINAL RESTORATION
ECHO ============================================================

SET FILTER TO
SET ORDER TO 0
TOP
AREA
STATUS
WSREPORT

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO LIST ORDERED STUDENTS CNX BASELINE X32 V2 END
ECHO ============================================================